      "content": "thanks for the advice but he's really adamant about not wanting to go to the doctor or the ER. he says he's fine and just felt a bit lightheaded. he's already feeling a little better after sipping some juice. if i just keep him hydrated and make sure he doesn't stand up too fast, is it really that big of a deal? it's just a few seconds of dizziness, right?",
